   <indicator aggregation-status="0" ascending="1" measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Number of crisis-affected people who are also involved in the design, implementation, monitoring and/or evaluation of the programme</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Participation is defined as the involvement of crisis-affected people in one or more phases of the programme: assessment, design, implementation, monitoring or evaluation. Participation does not take place when activities are carried out in exchange for a salary of &apos;in-kind&apos; payment unless the affected people are involved in decision-making processes and have an impact on decisions that affect them.Please describe in the actvity description what this involvement specifically entails and in which phase of the program conflict-affected people are involved.</narrative>
    </description>
